# Folio cover hall sensor.
#
# TB710FU's cover magnet is read by hall_detect.ko, whose "hall_irq" input
# device reports scan code 252 (HALL_NEAR, cover closed) and 253 (HALL_FAR,
# cover open) as EV_KEY presses. It advertises SW_LID but never emits it, so
# the native lid path cannot be used. Map the keys to the power keycodes so
# PhoneWindowManager turns the screen off when the cover closes and back on
# when it opens.

key 252   SLEEP
key 253   WAKEUP            WAKE
